  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Final evaluation of the &#xbf;Fit for Market: Strengthening competitiveness and sustainability of the ACP horticultural sector&#xbf; (FFM Programme) and &#xbf;Fit for Market - Strengthening sanitary and phytosanitary systems of the ACP horticultural sector&#xbf; (FFM-SPS Programme) - The overall objective of the programme is to reduce poverty, improve food security and food safety and ensure inclusive growth by strengthening the agri-food export sector in ACP countries.</narrative>
